#: docs/specifications/capabilities/cap-observability.md
msgid "CAP-OBSERVABILITY.1"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/capabilities/cap-observability.md
msgid "MUST"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/capabilities/cap-observability.md
msgid "Work records metrics per item, starting with a status of crashed that is overwritten on success, so a crashed item is never silently missing."
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/capabilities/cap-observability.md
msgid "Kill a run mid-item; the item's metric reads crashed."
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/capabilities/cap-observability.md
msgid "CAP-OBSERVABILITY.2"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/capabilities/cap-observability.md
msgid "Cost is attributable to the task that caused it, and reaches gold beside throughput."
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/capabilities/cap-observability.md
msgid "A gold model reports cost per task per period with item counts."
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/capabilities/cap-observability.md
msgid "CAP-OBSERVABILITY.3"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/capabilities/cap-observability.md
msgid "Health is judged from heartbeats and fresh output, not from process status."
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/capabilities/cap-observability.md
msgid "A hung process with a live status is detected by its stale heartbeat."
msgstr ""

